{
  "about": "claude-acc numbers measured before this benchmark suite existed, each with the date and the source it was measured and published in. They are not re-measured by a normal run; suites/claude-acc.mjs emits them as provenance.kind \"historical\". Every value is copied from its source as written; a range in the source stays a range (min and max, no median).",
